type: software
title: "pi-literature-review"
abstract: "Local, open, login-free literature review extension for the Pi coding agent: deterministic multi-source search (arXiv, CrossRef, OpenAlex, Semantic Scholar) with HTTP-verified identifiers, legal open-access PDF selection, and grounded synthesis over local PDFs with page-exact citations. No language model is in the citation path."
authors:
